---
/**
 * components/AdminHead.astro
 *
 * Drop-in for the <head> of admin pages that render the entity components (Info / Form / List views
 * and the search boxes). It:
 *   - pulls in the admin-only stylesheet that styles those components and sets the admin typeface,
 *   - preloads the Inter variable font so admin text does not flash an fallback face, and
 *   - emits the noindex robots directive every admin page needs (so pages no longer repeat it).
 *
 * Kept separate from BaseHead (and from the body-rendered AdminHeader) so this loads from the document
 * head and the public site does not ship the admin entity styles.
 */
import "../styles/admin-entities.css"
---

<meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
<link rel="preload" href="/fonts/InterVariable.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin />
